 Aggregate
   ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on tenk1
         Recheck Cond: ((stringu1 = 'TVAAAA'::name) OR (stringu1 = 'TVAAAB'::name))
         ->  BitmapOr
               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on hash_tuplesort_idx
